        "subject": "Your Purist Unsolved Skincare Appointment Has Been Rescheduled",
        "message": "=<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n   <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n   <style>\n     body { font-family: 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif; background-color: #f4f7f6; margin: 0; padding: 20px; color: #333333; }\n     .card { max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); }\n     .header { background: #d97706; color: #ffffff; padding: 24px; text-align: center; }\n     .header h2 { margin: 0; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 600; }\n     .content { padding: 28px 24px; }\n     .status-badge { display: inline-block; background-color: #fef3c7; color: #b45309; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; padding: 6px 14px; border-radius: 20px; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 20px; }\n     .details-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin: 20px 0; background-color: #fafafa; border-radius: 8px; }\n     .details-table td { padding: 12px 16px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eeeeee; font-size: 14px; }\n     .details-table tr:last-child td { border-bottom: none; }\n     .label { font-weight: 600; color: #666666; width: 40%; }\n     .value { font-weight: 500; color: #111111; }\n     .footer { text-align: center; padding: 20px; font-size: 12px; color: #888888; border-top: 1px solid #eeeeee; }\n   </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n   <div class=\"card\">\n     <div class=\"header\">\n       <h2>Purist Unsolved Skincare</h2>\n     </div>\n     <div class=\"content\">\n       <div class=\"status-badge\">🔄 Appointment Rescheduled</div>\n       <p>Hi <b>{{ $('Lookup Customer Email').first().json['Full Name'] || $('Lookup Active Booking in Sheets').first().json['Full Name'] || 'Valued Customer' }}</b>,</p>\n       <p>Your appointment has been successfully rescheduled. Here are your updated appointment details:</p>\n       \n       <table class=\"details-table\">\n         <tr>\n           <td class=\"label\">Appointment ID</td>\n           <td class=\"value\"><b>{{ $('Lookup Active Booking